[00:08.96] Tonight in a barroom, I'm sitting apart
[00:16.90] From the laughter and cheer
[00:22.58] The scenes of my life past before me
[00:29.50] While watching the bubbles in my beer.
[00:35.86] A vision of someone who loved me
[00:42.98] Brings along silent tear to my eye
[00:49.96] I know that my life's been a failure
[00:57.38] Just watching the bubbles in my beer.
[01:15.50] --- Instrumental ---
[01:15.52] I'm seeing the road that I've travelled
[01:15.52] A road paved with heartaches and tears
[01:46.38] I'm seeing the past that I've wasted
[01:54.82] While watching the bubbles in my beer.
[02:02.00] I think of the heart that I've broken
[02:08.66] And the golden chances that have passed me by
[02:15.28] The dreams I've once made now are over
[02:22.44] As empty as the bubbles in my beer...
